  (text "EVEI LIGHT METER - Arduino Mega 2560 carrier shield"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 20 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 3.5 3.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "e687c114-d997-4213-8049-c2b0074b8cd1")
  )
  (text "Pin map from the team sketch (Lightmeter_Week8.ino): SD CS=D53 (HW SPI 50/51/52), GPS=Serial1 (D18/D19), IMU=Serial2 (D16/D17), I2C=D20/D21,\nLEDs common-cathode to GND, active HIGH (setLED() in Week 5-8 sketches: YELLOW = both HIGH): GPS R=D4 G=D7, LUX R=D5 G=D6, IMU R=D8 G=D9; buttons to GND with INPUT_PULLUP: sleep D10, log toggle D11, force log D12."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 28 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "2f65a50a-e05c-458b-ab5b-f2c82d3b6e05")
  )
  (text "microSD: on-board socket, 3.3V LDO, 74LVC125 shifts MOSI/SCK/CS 5V->3.3V; MISO (3.3V) goes straight to D50 (same as Adafruit 254 breakout)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 130 20 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "1a6d6a1e-d97f-4cbe-9eab-f3ff698bedf0")
  )
  (text "IMU in UART mode: PS1 tied to breakout 3Vo via JP1. BNO SDA pin = UART TX -> Mega RX2 (D17); BNO SCL pin = UART RX -> Mega TX2 (D16)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 130 165 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "cbd01661-3ecf-4372-ba35-49fc3c840929")
  )
  (text "REV B ADDITIONS"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 430 30 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 3 3)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "27b4d92a-489c-4800-9321-19ad83fa44c0")
  )
  (text "Second TSL2591 (J10): fixed I2C address 0x29 clashes with LUX1, so it sits behind PCA9548A (U3, addr 0x70) channel 0.\nMux powers up with all channels off, so LUX1 on the main bus works with unchanged firmware. To read LUX2: write 0x01 to 0x70, read, write 0x00."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 430 38 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "f3f5ef6a-bfc5-4d19-9450-f16f1621b264")
  )
  (text "Encoder (J11): A -> D2 (INT4), B -> D3 (INT5). 10k pull-ups for open-collector encoders, 1k + 1nF filter and pin protection.\nGPS LED moved from D2/D3 to D4/D7 to free both interrupt pins: change gps_red = 4, gps_green = 7 in the sketch."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 430 140 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "56185cd0-70cb-40bd-8bb3-7127b8e3ac97")
  )
  (text "Connector pinouts (JST-XH): LCD/LUX = GND,5V,SDA,SCL   LEDx = GND(common cathode),RED,GREEN   BTNx = GND,SW,5V(lamp)"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 300 35 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "b84cb16b-ff0e-45bd-9096-ee8c545d2c7f")
  )
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/"
      (page "1")
    )
  )
